    "longDescription": "Scientific Calculator+ HD Free is the best and the most convenient scientific calculator in AppStore. \r\n\r\nWhy? \r\n\r\nApart from the usual features such as root, power, trigonometric functions, logarithms it also offers: \r\n- factorial (!) \r\n- double factorial (!!) \r\n- drawing graphs \r\n- four memory blocks \r\n- inserting constants \r\n- making notes \r\n- full history \r\n- random number generator \r\n- and many more... \r\n\r\nScientific Calculator+ HD Free is made by math/physics students. Our objective is to make it as convenient as traditional calculator, which we used at university. \r\n\r\nJust try it, you won't regret it :)\r\n",
